            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NAM 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Buno n'obukwenda obwava ye Katonda nga bugema ku kibuga Nineve. Nahumu ow'oku kyalo Elikoshi yafuna okwolekebwa, era bye yabona mu kwolekebwa ni bino ebyaghandiikibwa mu kitabo kino.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.1.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NAM 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NAM 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omuntu yava mu imwe eyo e Nineve ng'ali n'ebibi kamaala by'ategeike okukola yaidha yeesoomera Musengwa Katonda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.1.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NAM 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NAM 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye Musengwa Katonda akoba ati: “Abantu bange Abaisiraeli, waire nga Abassiria bali kamaala batyo era nga ba maani inho, nja kubazikiriza baweegho. Imwe waire nabatuusa ku kudaazibwadaazibwa, tija kwirayo kubaganha kudaagadaaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NAM 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Buti ni, nja kumenhamenha ebikoligo Abassiria abo bye baabata imwe mu nkoto, n'endhegere dhe baabasibya.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.1.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NAM 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NAM 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kino Musengwa Katonda ky'alagiire ekigema ku imwe Abassiria ati: “Eriina lyaimwe lija kwerabirwa, kuba tija kubaganha kufuna baidhukulu. Nja kuzikiriza ebifaananie eby'emisambwa gyaimwe ebyabaadhibwa, n'ebyo ebyakolebwa mu kyuma ekisaanuusiibwa ebiri mu masabo. Ndidha kubasimira amagombe, kuba timugwaine kuba ku nsi nga muli balamu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.1.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
